# kokoro-rknn decoder graphs known to be safe on the RK3588 NPU: sha256 of the 16 files
# (dec_T<T>_{A,B}.rknn) that ran in production on four Turing RK1 boards from 2026-11-02.
# They were compiled with rknn-toolkit2 2.3.2 by kokoro-rknn's build/ (the same surgery
# as KOKORO_RKNN_COMMIT), and their compile logs had 0 REGTASK errors.
#
# install.py --kokoro-buckets DIR accepts a graph when its hash is listed here or when
# DIR/logs has its compile log with no REGTASK error. Builds are not byte-reproducible
# (an x86-64 build of the same graph has another hash), so a graph built elsewhere needs
# its log. This file holds hashes only; no model is distributed with rk1-speech.
